SCENARIO: own task branch and claim still tear down safely
command: FM_HOME=<isolated-home> bin/fm-teardown.sh own-task --force
exit=0
teardown own-task complete (window firstmate:fm-own-task, worktree <fixture>/worktree)
Backlog: own-task just finished (this home keeps no markdown backlog at <fixture>/home/data/backlog.md). Update <fixture>/home/data/backlog.md - move own-task to Done, keep Done to the 10 most recent, then re-scan Queued and dispatch only work whose blockers are gone and date is due.
